H. S. Ray and L. Pugazhenthy, IIT Kharagpur. Non-ferrous Extractive Metallurgy, NPTEL 113105021. [Official course](https://nptel.ac.in/courses/113105021) · [Complete syllabus](https://archive.nptel.ac.in/content/syllabus_pdf/113105021.pdf).

Read/watch the entire public sequence with its examples: chemical and physical principles, oxide/sulfide/halide feed families, pyro/hydro/electrometallurgy, refining, aluminium, copper and other metal systems, secondary production, energy, and environment. The grouping by feed chemistry makes similarities and important differences explicit.

The official course lists both contributors; the syllabus identifies Ray as coordinator. Identity, scope, and public contents were checked on 29 October 2026. These are dated teaching cases, compared with later full technical sources where used. Preserve actual course/component terms. Public access is not represented as a universally open licence or proof that all linked material has been inspected. Nothing is mirrored here.

